Z||000000||FieroGTguy||07-06-2001||01:32 AM||||I am going to add a photo gallary to <A HREF="http://www.FieroStuff.com," TARGET=_blank>www.FieroStuff.com,</A>  but the catch is they must have a modification.  Body, interior, engine, or custom paint.<P>Post your pics to this thread, and I'll pull them from here.  If there are a lot of awesome car pictures, I'll make a show car catagory.<P>By posting them here, you permit me and any Fiero Site webmaster to use them for positive display.<P>I may not post them all because I am looking for the best of the best, but there are a lot of other webmasters that would be willing to post your great Fiero pictures.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>P.S.  <A HREF="http://www.FieroStuff.com" TARGET=_blank>www.FieroStuff.com</A>  is going to be the center for Fiero Modification and pictures to inspire others to continue improving on the cars we love.  It will be redesigned after pictures and vendor lists are completed.<P>Greg||||reg||1
